  ('pol_1001', 'usr_customer', 'Saathi Health Insurance Co. Ltd. (Demo)', 'Saathi Secure Plus – Individual', 'SHI-2023-0045871', 500000, 5000, 10000, 10, '2023-04-01 04:30:00.000', '2027-03-31 18:29:00.000', '[{"name":"Initial waiting period (except accidents)","months":1},{"name":"Specific illnesses (cataract, hernia, joint replacement, ENT)","months":24},{"name":"Pre-existing diseases","months":36},{"name":"Maternity","months":24}]'::jsonb, '{"cataractPerEye":40000,"maternity":50000,"ambulance":2000}'::jsonb, '["Cosmetic or plastic surgery (unless after an accident)","Dental treatment unless it needs hospitalisation","Self-inflicted injury, substance abuse","Infertility and assisted reproduction","Non-medical items (toiletries, attendant, admission kit)","War, nuclear hazards, adventure sports","OPD treatment and routine check-ups"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Your policy covers hospital stays up to ₹5,00,000. Room rent is covered up to ₹5,000 per day; a costlier room reduces other charges too. You pay 10% of every claim (co-pay), and some treatments have waiting periods: 30 days for most illnesses, 2 years for cataract, joint replacement and maternity, 3 years for pre-existing diseases.', 'आपकी पॉलिसी अस्पताल में भर्ती होने पर ₹5,00,000 तक का खर्च कवर करती है। कमरे का किराया ₹5,000 प्रति दिन तक कवर है; महंगा कमरा लेने पर बाकी खर्चों में भी कटौती होती है। हर क्लेम में 10% आपको देना होगा (को-पे)। वेटिंग पीरियड: ज़्यादातर बीमारियों के लिए 30 दिन, मोतियाबिंद, जॉइंट रिप्लेसमेंट और मैटरनिटी के लिए 2 साल, और पहले से मौजूद बीमारियों के लिए 3 साल।', 'sample/CLM-1001_Rahul_Sharma_SETTLED/02_Policy_Schedule.pdf', 'Saathi Health Insurance Co. Ltd. (Demo)
